# A link carried from one process's window to another's (design 11.4), for
# tools/ui_run.py: a link of 予定表 (window at 100,100, in front of it to x 920)
# let go over 基本表計算 moved to x 600 (its grid from y 150 down). Refused above
# the cells and where no program takes links, the keys stay with 予定表; taken on
# a cell, the keys go to the sheet, what is typed goes in it, and the link stays
# in 予定表. That a process may not pass on what either side may not read is
# the kernel test's (drop, test_grant).
# A drop is at the corner of the outline carried, not where the hand is (design
# 11.4): the link of TADjsについて (324,403 to 454,422 in 仮身サンプル, pressed at
# 400,414) let go with the hand at 820,520 stands in 予定表 at 744,509 to 876,528.
# Moved 520 left by a press near its left end (224,509 to 356,528), it is carried
# from 230,518, so that the outline's corner is 6 left of and 9 above the hand: let
# go with the hand at 1000,300, the corner is in the column E (980 to 1060) of row 7.
open 019d6f00-1a2b-7c3d-8e4f-a1b2c3d4e5f6
expect calendar: ready
wait 800
open 019a4370-3819-79a2-9758-881e1e0de90a
wait 1000
drag 400 414 820 520
expect calendar: dropped 1
wait 500
drag 750 518 230 518
expect calendar: moved 1
wait 300
open 019b54a4-6ccf-72f7-e320-c98e4a0bab4e
expect calc: ready
wait 800
drag 500 108 1000 108
wait 500
win 基本表計算
# refused by the sheet, above its cells: the keys come back to 予定表
wait 3000
move 230 518
down
wait 4000
move 960 130
wait 4000
move 1000 130
wait 500
shot pd_carrying
up
expect calendar: carried
wait 800
focus pd_refused 予定表
shot pd_refused
# over the background, above 基本表計算 and right of the 原紙箱 (a box that takes links):
# no program takes them, the desktop says no, and nothing moves
wait 3000
move 230 518
down
wait 4000
move 1160 60
wait 4000
move 1200 60
wait 500
up
wait 800
focus pd_notaker 予定表
shot pd_notaker
absent calc: dropped
# on a cell: the keys go to the sheet
wait 3000
move 230 518
down
wait 4000
move 960 300
wait 4000
move 1000 300
wait 500
up
expect calc: dropped 1
expect calendar: carried
absent calendar: moved out
focus pd_taken 基本表計算
shot pd_taken
text 7
key 28
expect calc: set E7 shows 7
win 予定表
shot pd_end
